    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「すまないね、ドタバタしていて。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「これでは、落ちついて本も読めないだろう？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「懇親会が終わるまでは図書室はじゃっかん騒々しいから、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「分厚いのを借りて自宅でゆっくり読むといい♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 58,
